      "value": "<p><em>10th-level Shadow feature</em></p><p>You learn how to invoke creature's deepest, darkest fears. When a creature starts their turn frightened or charmed by you, or while under the effect of one of your Shadow Calling spells, their movement speed is halved and they can't take reactions until the start of their next turn.</p>",
